-- title:
--   Lemma 5.1 — CMPGA in epoch indices
-- statement:
--   Suppose Assumption 2 holds, let $(x^{(t)},y^{(t)})$ be generated by CMPGA (blocks visited cyclically, $i_{(t)}=t\bmod(N+1)$, any memory $M$), and write $(x^{(k,i)},y^{(k,i)})=(x^{(k(N+1)+i)},y^{(k(N+1)+i)})$ (38). Let $\mathcal S$ be built from a bound $\bar g_{\mathcal X}$ and $\underline\alpha$, and $C_0=\min\{\sigma/2,1/\bar\alpha\}$. Then
--
--   1. for all $k,i\in\mathbb N$, $(x^{(k,i)},y^{(k,i)})\in\mathcal S$ and
--   $$
--   \zeta(x^{(k,i+1)})+C_0\big(\|x^{(k,i+1)}-x^{(k,i)}\|_2^2+Q_{(l(k(N+1)+i))}\|y^{(k,i+1)}-y^{(k,i)}\|_2^2\big)\le Q_{(l(k(N+1)+i))}\,\eta(x^{(k,i+1)},y^{(k,i+1)});\tag{42}
--   $$
--   2. there is $Q_{c\infty}\in[0,F(x^{(0)})]$ with $\lim_{k\to\infty}Q_{(l(k(N+1)+i))}=Q_{c\infty}$ for every $i\in\{0,\dots,N\}$;
--   3. for every $i\in\mathbb N$, $\lim_{k\to\infty}\big(\|x^{(k,i+1)}-x^{(k,i)}\|_2^2+Q_{c\infty}\|y^{(k,i+1)}-y^{(k,i)}\|_2^2\big)=0$ (43).
--
--   **Formalization Note** (42) is stated in the extended reals.
--
--   Differences from the source:
--   - encoding: ℝⁿ and ℝⁿ × ℝⁿ with the Euclidean norm and inner product → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) (Vec n) and WithLp 2 (Vec n × Vec n) (Pair n); reason: Lean convention; the same norms and inner products
--   - encoding: h : ℝⁿ → (−∞, +∞] proper lower semicontinuous, locally Lipschitz differentiable on Ω → h : Vec n → ℝ, differentiable on Ω with gradient locally Lipschitz relative to Ω; reason: h enters only through ζ = f + h and ∇h on the open set Ω; its values off Ω change no value of F or Q, no critical point and no accepted step (a trial point outside Ω fails the line-search test, since η ≤ g = 0 there and ζ ≥ 0 on dom f)
--   - encoding: subvectors x₁, …, x_N partitioning the coordinates of x, blocks i ∈ ℕ_N = {1, …, N} → a surjective blk : Fin n → Fin N with block spaces EuclideanSpace ℝ {j // blk j = i}; paper block i is index i − 1; reason: Lean convention; the same partitions into nonempty blocks
--   - encoding: extended values in (−∞, +∞] and [−∞, +∞) → EReal, with the real quotient on the finite branch of F and Q; reason: Lean convention; the same values
--   - encoding: y = prox_{αg*}(·) and x_i(α) ∈ prox_{αf_i}(·) → membership in the argmin set proxSet α φ v; reason: the prox of the convex g* is a single point, so membership and equality agree; the prox of f_i is set-valued as on p.13
--   - encoding: Q_(t) = Q(x^(t), y^(t)) (or Q(x, y)) inside the prox argument of Step 2-X → (Q x y).toReal (xStepInput); reason: it is evaluated only on dom(Q) (Theorem 4.6(ii), or (x, y) ∈ S), where the real value is Q(x, y)
--   - encoding: Step 2-X: backtrack α ← αγ from α̃(t) until the test holds → trial points p k at α̃(t)γᵏ for k ≤ j, the test failing for k < j and holding at k = j; α(t) = α̃(t)γʲ; reason: the same runs; the failed trials are recorded because Theorem 4.6(i) is about them
--   - encoding: Q_(l(t)) with l(t) = max{j ≤ t : Q_(j) = max{Q_(s) : [t − M]₊ ≤ s ≤ t}} → Qwin M x y t = ⨆ s ∈ [t − M, t], Q(x s, y s) in EReal (ℕ subtraction is [·]₊); reason: Q_(l(t)) is that maximum; the index l(t) is not needed
--   - generalization: one y-step size α := α̃_Y ∈ [α̲, ᾱ] in Algorithm 1 → a y-step size α(t) ∈ [α̲, ᾱ] that may differ between y-steps; reason: §5.1 (39) writes 'some α(k,0) ∈ [α̲, ᾱ]' and the proofs use only α(t) ∈ [α̲, ᾱ]; a constant α̃_Y is the special case, so the statement specializes to the source
--   - reading: ḡ_X > 0 given by Remark 1(i) → any gbar > 0 with g ≤ gbar on X, a parameter of Y and S; reason: Remark 1(i) only asserts that such a bound exists and every result holds for each one; η ≤ g is Fenchel–Young, not a hypothesis
-- source:
--   Zhou, Zhang, Li, An equivalent reformulation and multi-proximity gradient algorithms for a class of nonsmooth fractional programming, arXiv:2311.00957v2, §5.1, p.21, Lemma 5.1

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_FracMPGA_liftedRatio
import Definitions.Def_FracMPGA_Problem
import Definitions.Def_FracMPGA_Assumption1
import Definitions.Def_FracMPGA_setS
import Definitions.Def_FracMPGA_IsMPGARun
open Filter Topology

namespace FracMPGA

/-- **Lemma 5.1** of Zhou, Zhang, Li, arXiv:2311.00957v2, p.21: suppose that Assumption 2 holds.
Let `{(x⁽ᵗ⁾, y⁽ᵗ⁾)}` be generated by CMPGA, and `(x^{(k,i)}, y^{(k,i)}) = (x^{(k(N+1)+i)},
y^{(k(N+1)+i)})` (38). Then
(i) for any `(k, i)`, `(x^{(k,i)}, y^{(k,i)}) ∈ S` and
`ζ(x^{(k,i+1)}) + C₀(‖x^{(k,i+1)} − x^{(k,i)}‖₂² + Q_(l(k(N+1)+i))‖y^{(k,i+1)} − y^{(k,i)}‖₂²)
 ≤ Q_(l(k(N+1)+i)) η(x^{(k,i+1)}, y^{(k,i+1)})` (42);
(ii) there exists some `Q_{c∞} ∈ [0, F(x⁽⁰⁾)]` such that `lim_{k→∞} Q_(l(k(N+1)+i)) = Q_{c∞}` for
any `i ∈ ℕ⁰_N`;
(iii) furthermore, `lim_{k→∞} ‖x^{(k,i+1)} − x^{(k,i)}‖₂² + Q_{c∞}‖y^{(k,i+1)} − y^{(k,i)}‖₂² = 0`
(43) for any `i ∈ ℕ`.

**Formalization Note** Assumption 1 is `hA1`, Assumption 2 is `IsCompact (P.levelX (x 0))`; the
run is CMPGA (`I t = t mod (N+1)`) with any memory `M`, and `S = P.setS (x 0) gbar αlo` for a bound
`gbar` of Remark 1(i). `C₀ = min{σ/2, 1/ᾱ}` (Theorem 4.6). The page writes `(k, i) ∈ ℕ × ℕ` in (i)
and `i ∈ ℕ` in (iii); (38) defines `x^{(k,i)}` for every `i`, and both items are stated for every
natural `i`. (ii) is stated for `0 ≤ i ≤ N`. -/
theorem lemma_5_1 {n N : ℕ} (P : Problem n N) (hA1 : Assumption1 P) (αlo αhi σ γ : ℝ) (M : ℕ)
    (x y : ℕ → Vec n) (α : ℕ → ℝ) (hrun : P.IsCMPGARun αlo αhi σ γ M x y α)
    (hA2 : IsCompact (P.levelX (x 0))) (gbar : ℝ) (hgbar : 0 < gbar)
    (hgX : ∀ z ∈ P.levelX (x 0), P.g z ≤ gbar) :
    (∀ k i : ℕ, pair (x (k * (N + 1) + i)) (y (k * (N + 1) + i)) ∈ P.setS (x 0) gbar αlo ∧
      P.zeta (x (k * (N + 1) + i + 1)) + ((min (σ / 2) (1 / αhi) : ℝ) : EReal) *
          (((‖x (k * (N + 1) + i + 1) - x (k * (N + 1) + i)‖ ^ 2 : ℝ) : EReal) +
            P.Qwin M x y (k * (N + 1) + i) *
              ((‖y (k * (N + 1) + i + 1) - y (k * (N + 1) + i)‖ ^ 2 : ℝ) : EReal)) ≤
        P.Qwin M x y (k * (N + 1) + i) *
          P.eta (x (k * (N + 1) + i + 1)) (y (k * (N + 1) + i + 1))) ∧
    ∃ Qc : ℝ, 0 ≤ Qc ∧ (Qc : EReal) ≤ P.F (x 0) ∧
      (∀ i : ℕ, i ≤ N →
        Tendsto (fun k => P.Qwin M x y (k * (N + 1) + i)) atTop (𝓝 (Qc : EReal))) ∧
      (∀ i : ℕ, Tendsto (fun k => ‖x (k * (N + 1) + i + 1) - x (k * (N + 1) + i)‖ ^ 2 +
          Qc * ‖y (k * (N + 1) + i + 1) - y (k * (N + 1) + i)‖ ^ 2) atTop (𝓝 0)) := by sorry

end FracMPGA
